  <!--
    Neutral (fallback) resources: Russian. The project sets NeutralLanguage=ru, so a request for
    Russian is served straight from the main assembly and never depends on a satellite being
    present. English lives in AppStrings.en.resx and ships as TurntableSpeed.App.resources.dll.

    Every {0} placeholder is filled with a string the caller has already formatted with the
    invariant culture, so a translation must keep the placeholders but never assumes a locale.
  -->
